		(uuid "5249dbc6-3ecd-46f9-8919-e94681564927")
	)
	(text "NOTES  (source of truth: power-stage-netlist.json, 2026-10-13)\n- B- and GND are DIFFERENT nets. B- = cell negative before M1/M2; GND = system ground after M2 (= P-). Never join them.\n- PLACEHOLDERS - VERIFY before ordering:\n    R10 316k (FSW ~500 kHz, check TPS61088 datasheet eq. 2)\n    R13 6.8k / C13 6.8nF (boost compensation starting point)\n- TBD parts (to pick): F3 PTC ~5 A hold 2920;  L3 0.47 uH, Isat >= 4 A, DCR <= 25 mR (TI suggests Coilcraft XFL4015-471ME), footprint not assigned.\n- M1/M2 WSD20100DN56: no EasyEDA model. Generic SSSGD symbol + TDSON-8-1 footprint, pinout ASSUMED (1-3 S, 4 G, 5-8+EP D). VERIFY.\n- BT1 BH-18650-A1AJ006: pin 2 = +, pin 1 = - taken from the EasyEDA symbol drawing; footprint has no polarity mark. VERIFY.\n- Q2 pulls MPPT low to stop charging: bench-verify.  R26 optional (DNP if ESP_BB_MODE unused).\n- F4/F5/F6 (PTC 3 A 1812, C2892380) belong on the cardinal boards (Sthymuli-cardinalboard), not on this sheet.\n- Refs renamed to KiCad-numeric (original in field JSON_Ref): C1A/B/C=C102/103/104, C2A/B=C105/106, C10A/B/C=C107/108/109,\n    C12A/B/C/D=C110..C113, C21A/B=C114/115, RCS=R16.\n- ESP32: NTC_ADC=IO5, VBAT_ADC=IO6, ESP_CHG_OFF=IO21, ESP_5V_EN=IO46, ESP_BB_MODE=IO45, CHG_CHRG=IO3, CHG_DONE=MCP23017 GPA3, BB_PG=MCP23017 GPA4.\nLAYOUT (later): boost input loop C10-L2-U3 PGND tight (~7 A peak), C12 next to VOUT, pad = thermal path.\n  Charger: Kelvin-route CSP and BAT sense from RCS pads.  Protection: M1/M2 and P+/B-/GND copper sized for ~7 A continuous."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 310 337 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5a7a90f0-76f5-4ffc-becb-6a3940d871ca")
	)
